  "patthana3.10:69.1": "dhammo ganthassa dhammassa . . . Dānaṃ sīlaṃ uposathakammaṃ katvā taṃ assādeti abhinandati, taṃ ārabbha rāgo uppajjati, diṭṭhi ",
  "patthana3.10:70.1": "",
  "patthana3.10:71.1": "uppajjati, . . . ",
  "patthana3.10:72.1": "pe . . . domanassaṃ ",
  "patthana3.10:73.1": "uppajjati. Pubbe ",
  "patthana3.10:74.1": "suciṇṇāni . . . jhānā ",
  "patthana3.10:75.1": "vuṭṭhahitvā jhānaṃ, . . . cakkhuṃ . . . ",
  "patthana3.10:76.1": "pe . . . vatthuṃ noganthe ",
  "patthana3.10:77.1": "khandhe assādeti abhinandati, ",
  "patthana3.10:78.0.1": "taṃ ",
  "patthana3.10:78.0.2": "",
  "patthana3.10:78.1": "ārabbha rāgo uppajjati . . . pe . . . domanassaṃ uppajjati. 6. Nogantho dhammo ganthassa ca noganthassa . . . Dānaṃ . . . ārabbha ganthā ca sampayuttakā ca khandhā uppajjanti. Pubbe suciṇṇāni . . . taṃ ārabbha ganthā ca sampayuttakā ca khandhā uppajjanti. 7. Gantho ca nogantho ca dhammā ganthassa . . . ",
