  "patthana3.10:199.1": "dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo . . . (tīṇi, ārammaṇasadisā; garukārammaṇā kātabbā). 4. Nogantho dhammo noganthassa dhammassa . . . Ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati. Ārammaṇādhipati:-- dānaṃ sīlaṃ uposathakammaṃ . . . pubbe . . . jhānā . . . Ariyā maggā . . . phalaṃ . . . Nibbānaṃ gotrabhussa vodānassa maggassa phalassa āvajjanāya adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Cakkhuṃ . . . pe . . . vatthuṃ noganthe khandhe garuṃ katvā assādeti adhinandati, taṃ garuṃ katvā rāgo uppajjati, diṭṭhi uppajjati, . . . pe . . . Sahajātādhipati:-- noganthādhipati sampayuttakānaṃ khandhānaṃ cittasamuṭṭhānānañ ca rūpānaṃ adhipatipaccayena paccayo. 5. Nogantho dhammo ganthassa dhammassa . . . Ārammaṇādhipahi . . . jhānā . . . Cakkhuṃ . . . vatthuṃ noganthe khandhe . . . pe . . . Sahajātādhipati:-- noganthādhipati ganthānaṃ adhipatipaccayena paccayo. 6. Nogantho dhammo ganthassa ca noganthassa . . . Ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati. Ārammaṇādhipati:-- dānaṃ . . . pe . . . noganthe khandhe garuṃ katvā assādeti abhinandati, taṃ garuṃ katvā ganthā ca sampayuttakā ca khandhā uppajjanti. Sahajātādhipati:-- noganthādhipati sampāyuttakānaṃ khandhānaṃ ganthānañ ca cittasamuṭṭhānānañ ca rūpānaṃ adhipatipaccayena paccayo. 7. Gantho ca nogantho ca dhammā ganthassa . . . Ārammaṇādhipati . . . (tīṇi). 1. Gantho dhammo ganthassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Purimā purimā ganthā pacchimānaṃ pacchimānaṃ ganthanaṃ anantarapaccayena paccayo. 2. Gantho dhammo noganthassa dhammassa . . . Purimā . . . pacchimānaṃ noganthānaṃ khandhānaṃ anantarapaccayena paccayo. Ganthā vuṭṭhānassa nanatarapaccayena paccayo. 3. Gantho dhammo ganthassa ca noganthassa . . . Purimā . . . ganthānaṃ sampayuttakānañ ca khandhānaṃ anantarapaccayena paccayo. 4. Nogantho dhammo noganthassa . . . (tīṇi). (Dve āvajjanā kātabbā. Paṭhame natthi.) 7. ",
